{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00657","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 钧天舞 · 张说","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 钧天舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高皇迈道，端拱无爲。\n化怀獯鬻，兵赋句骊。\n礼尊封禅，乐盛来仪。\n合位娲后，同称伏羲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00657.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00657","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}